  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2024" />
  <Thumbnail>2f9e1679-25f8-49d1-b844-01e66496000f</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="23-11-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (charts are a mess.  white mode has two controls mapped to channel 12.  bumped up for now.  some ranges and controls are vague)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="18-04-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with 04/2024 charts (significant changes.  removes string parts from standard mode and adds separate pixel engine modes, changes zoom to 16bit.  gobos changed - note majority of images are very low quality)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="18-04-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" Version="1" />
  <History Date="19-04-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="2" />
  <History Date="22-04-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase IDs for RGB and RGBA pixel engine modes." Version="3" />
